  "body": "For your information. I've recently become aware of the following proposal, by Markus Scherer, that deals with the recommended way to handle invalid UTF-8.  It was recently uploaded to the Unicode Web site and I believe it may be relevant to the Encoding Standard:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.unicode.org/L2/L2017/17168-utf-8-recommend.pdf\r\n\r\nNote that this is merely a proposal; and I have no opinion on whether the Encoding Standard should adopt this proposal if it's adopted by the Unicode Technical Committee and/or incorporated into a future version of the Unicode Standard.",
